*(reference-right
  <div id='datacenter_right_col'>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <span style="font-family: Verdana,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 110%; margin-bottom: 6px;">
        <b>References at MaizeGDB</b>
      </span>
      <br>
      MaizeGDB maintains a set of hand-curated references. These include 
      all <a href="/hot_new_papers">papers</a> recommended by the editoral 
      board.
      <br><br>
      For a more thorough literature search, you can use the PubMed
      provided on the left, or try literature search engines such as
      <a href="http://scholar.google.com/">Google Scholar<a>.
      <br><br>
      If you wish to annotate a locus or gene model with your reference, please 
      use the annotation tools on those pages. If we need to add your reference 
      to MaizeGDB, please contact us.
    </p>
    <br>
  </div>
)
